MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_001: Dang it! Helping that granny ate into my precious\ntraining time.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_002: Gotta hurry! It's juuust past this alley...
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_003: Bah, that guy was all bark, no bite. Lousy\ndrunken bum.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_004: Tryin'a pick a fight with the great Majide, huh?\nFat chance of winning, haha! Oof!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_005: Huh? Oomph!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_006: My bad, kid. If you got a boo-boo, don't worry. I bet\nyour mama will kiss it better for ya.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_007: Excuse you?! Like I'd get a "boo-boo" from running\ninto a moron like you!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_008: 'Scuse me?! 'Scuse you! The great Majide was\nshowing mercy! That's my thanks?!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_009: Take your mercy and shove it, buddy. Anyway, I\ndon't have a mom—I was made in a machine.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_010: Huh? What are you talking about?
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_011: {SetColor=Gray}Shoot, got all amped up and accidentally spilled\na village secret to some weirdo...{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_012: Hahaha! Well I have the strength of 10 men!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_013: I'm way more special and interesting than the likes\nof a little pup.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_014: {SetColor=Gray}Oh, phew. This idiot doesn't hear very well. Or listen\nfor that matter.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_015: Hey, you hear me? I'm telling you how impressive I\nam—least you could do is listen!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_016: Oh yeah, I'm listening, alright. "Strength of 10 men,\nblah, blah, blah." What a joke.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_017: If we're talking like that, then I've got the strength of\n20—no, 30—men! Beating you'd be easy!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_018: Be warned, pipsqueak, if I go all out, it's more like\na HUNDRED men over here!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_019: Then make it THREE hundred for me! I'd knock you\nflat in two seconds!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_020: You rude little punk! C'mere! I'll beat you to a pulp\nwith one arm behind my back!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_021: Hyah! Eat this! My fist is as strong as a Mediator's!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_022: Ha! A horse cart could run me over, and I'd be ready\nfor more. I am the strongest man alive! Hyaah!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_023: Haaah... Haaah... Hell, you're tough as nails... Pretty\ngood training session...
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_024: Haaah... Haah. Told ya. Turns out this pipsqueak\nhas some meat on his bones after all.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_025: Well, any way you cut it, I'm stronger than you. I was\neven still tired from running earlier.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_026: Oh, we're making excuses? Well, I'm even stronger.\nI'm actually still kinda drunk and woozy right now.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_027: Pfft, come on! You're just looking for excuses 'cause\nyou can't face the truth that you lost.
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_028: I'm not making excuses! Fine, then! Let's go another\nround!
MID_SE_Naz_Maj_C_029: Sounds good! Happy to slam that big mouth of yours\nshut a second time.